  "ruleText": "Ath 404.06 Method for Determining Sanctions. To determine which sanction or combination of sanctions to impose, Plc 311.10 shall govern.\n\nSource. #9099, eff 3-1-08; ss by #10921, eff 8-29-15; renumbered by #13307, eff 12-17-21 (formerly Ath 404.07); ss by #14247, eff 5-16-25, EXPIRES: 5-16-35",
